<title>BELGIUM: Belgian money market supply raised in week.</title>
<headline>Belgian money market supply raised in week.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank said it added liquidity to the money market in the week to Monday to offset higher deposits at the bank by financial intermediaries.</p>
<p>(figures from the  weekly statement in bln francs) -</p>
<p> Foreign currency reserves	   407.671 (+ 0.088)</p>
<p> Advances against pledged security  15.506 (+ 0.143)</p>
<p> Commercial bills			  3.251 (- 0.044)</p>
<p> Securities portfolio		   22.816 (+ 0.000)</p>
<p> Money market interventions	  109.640 (+ 4.929)</p>
<p> Bank notes in circulation	   444.637 (+ 0.698)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
